Subject: kernel: use canonical git.kernel.org snapshot URL for rc tarballs

The short torvalds/t URL returns a redirect that the download helper
cannot reliably follow within its timeout. Use the canonical snapshot
path so Linux 7.4-rc3 can be fetched directly.

--- a/include/kernel.mk
+++ b/include/kernel.mk
@@ -66,1 +66,1 @@
-      LINUX_SITE:=https://git.kernel.org/torvalds/t
+      LINUX_SITE:=http://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/snapshot
